{"overview":"در قلب قاره‌ای شامل هشت پادشاهی، پادشاهی مارونیِر قرار دارد. ژنرال این سرزمین، باریبارا، هفت پسر دارد که هر یک توانایی منحصر به فردی دارند و به‌عنوان فرماندهٔ شوالیه خدمت می‌کنند؛ آن‌ها با هدف نیکوکارانهٔ نجات یک روز شاهزاده‌دختری، به‌عنوان سفیران صلح به هفت پادشاهی همسایه می‌روند. چه ماجراها، آزمون‌ها و سرنوشت‌هایی در این سرزمین‌های ناشناخته در انتظارشان است؟","tagline":"","overview_en":"At the heart of a continent of eight kingdoms lies the Marronnier Kingdom. Its general, Baribara, has seven sons, each with a unique gift and serving as a knight commander. Bound by a single noble cause of heroically rescuing a princess someday, the brothers set out as goodwill ambassadors to the seven neighboring kingdoms. What encounters, trials, and destinies await them in these unknown lands?","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":20,"y":2026,"poster":"/g3G9DHjjRBKdm8SbHVU2w3Cmp51.jpg"}],"episodes":20,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP","US"],"cast":[{"name":"高梨謙吾","role":"Insomniac (voice)","photo":"/hLf6via4ImfR54sOqD2LakjzsFb.jpg","en":"Kengo Takanashi"},{"name":"谷川誠","role":"Fraternity (voice)","photo":"/3k5NvRU4otKIRERHub09xAc9V3M.jpg","en":"Makoto Tanikawa"},{"name":"石谷春貴","role":"Feverish (voice)","photo":"/5bugNo9kjEpzotXLkvMZ2pJ212h.jpg","en":"Haruki Ishiya"},{"name":"猪股慧士","role":"Chilly (voice)","photo":"/hAoRLGuberMhFY1f6ULJGiIu1e.jpg","en":"Satoshi Inomata"},{"name":"水野清人","role":"Beast-Tamer (voice)","photo":"/cNSSowoQ54rPecGLGHZqKJ84s1r.jpg","en":"Kiyoto Mizuno"},{"name":"村田太志","role":"Swordsman (voice)","photo":"/eVs2Ow2CyiFfoN02EUNyhmSYALE.jpg","en":"Taishi Murata"},{"name":"川島零士","role":"Hungry (voice)","photo":"/tJriYA3tctzKP3ZnAwsxkey9iyU.jpg","en":"Reiji Kawashima"},{"name":"渡辺明乃","role":"Baribara (voice)","photo":"/4E05IJxvTGNHb2GSaiyxbCZ5nd8.jpg","en":"Akeno Watanabe"},{"name":"速水奨","role":"Narrator (voice)","photo":"/HU9LZJdb4H8coHiSaHiUprcFm1.jpg","en":"Show Hayami"}],"trailer"